{"id":"temporada","lemma":"temporada","pos":"noun","rank":1307,"glosses":["season, period, span of time","season, series (group of episodes of a television broadcast)"],"ipa":"/tempoˈɾada/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"temporadas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/15/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-temporada.wav","examples":[{"text":"Me encanta esta temporada del año.","en":"I love this time of year.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/522280","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to charm, to enchant","l":"encantar"},{"g":"this","l":"este"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"year"}]},{"text":"¿Cuándo empieza la temporada de pesca?","en":"When does fishing season start?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/522242","words":[{"g":"when"},{"g":"to start","l":"empezar"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"fishing"}]},{"text":"Es temporada de venados.","en":"It's deer season.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442823","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"deer, stag","l":"venado"}]},{"text":"Las fresas ya están de temporada.","en":"Strawberries are in season now.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/582403","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"strawberry","l":"fresa"},{"g":"now"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"El verano es la temporada más cálida.","en":"Summer is the hottest season.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/64336","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"summer"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"more"},{"g":"warm","l":"cálido"}]}]}